   269	- **F** (fork reference): `PYTHONPATH=ref:python`.
   270	- **P** (plugin `compat+hisparse`): `PYTHONPATH=<plugin entry-point dir>:<plugin>/src:pin:python`,
   271	  `SGLANG_QSA_MODEL_COMPAT=1`, `SGLANG_QSA_HISPARSE_V3=p2-offload`, `SGLANG_PLUGINS=qsa_hisparse`.
