   273	  files (from `ref:`) and job order. Each arm gets its own `SGLANG_CACHE_DIR`,
   274	  events dir, controller state dir and output dir. Jobs run strictly one at a time. Record
   275	  `git rev-parse`, the plugin tree hash, the SHA256 of the 19 manifest files
   276	  (F) and of the plugin package (P), interpreter package versions, the
   277	  `nvidia-smi` snapshot and `/get_server_info` for every arm.
